# a narrowed run hands necro rust-docs the given files, as it does necro grep
spec: Narrowed runs
args: --format terse src/a.rs
exit: 1
-- necro.yaml --
version: 0
include: [necro:rust-style]
-- src/a.rs --
fn a() {}
-- src/b.rs --
fn b() {}
-- @stdout --
src/a.rs:1:1: rust-style/module-doc a file with no //! module doc
